 ## AI Agent Support
 
-Chitra is designed for AI agent workflows. Use `toPlain()` or `toJSON()` to integrate with agents:
+Chitra is designed for AI agent workflows. Every chart result exposes three
+agent-friendly output helpers — pick the one that fits the surface:
+
+- `toPlain()` — plain text with all ANSI color codes stripped
+- `toMarkdown()` — the same plain text wrapped in a fenced ```code block```
+- `toJSON()` — a structured object: `{ type, data, labels, title, plain }`
 
 ```ts
-// For MCP servers and LLM tools
-const chartData = line({
+// For MCP servers and LLM tools — return the plain text as a tool result
+const chart = line({
   data: metrics,
   title: "Response Times",
-  noColor: true,     // No ANSI for LLM consumption
-}).toPlain();
+});
 
-// Return as tool result
-return { content: [{ type: "text", text: chartData }] };
+return { content: [{ type: "text", text: chart.toPlain() }] };
 ```
 
 ```ts
